      "mergedPostDetails": "Every time, when i join the (new) world, camera starts very low at my leg height and NOT at my head height.\n\nIn Live version (at 25-11-2024 date) i have no problems and camera stays just good where it's supposed if i join worlds.\n\nBut this beta... it spawns at legs height in every new world. If i pick up camera to correct height and rejoin same world again, camera is not more at leg height, but not exact same position. It spawns more toward my chest. Even i corrected it by moving it, it don't want keep position and will spawn to chest again.\n\nSo far i can see, spawn position is still incorrect in Beta 1548. Live has no problems and stay at correct position where i put camera there. I am streamer, so i know this is not correct. Please make sure it's fixed for next Live release.",
